@page "/"
@inject IContentService ContentService

<PageTitle>@Constants.SiteName - Home</PageTitle>

<div class="center">
    <img src="images/icons/logo.png" alt="A poorly doodled spiral in which one swirl is highlighted as an orange 'c'." />
</div>
<div class="content">
    <h2 class="center">Welcome</h2>
    <div class="section">
        <p>
            Hi! Thanks for checking out my dev page.
        </p>
        <p>
            Codespirals is a small solo (for now) software project from Switzerland whose goal is to create a solid foundation of code libraries and modules to build interesting and helpful projects on top of.
        </p>
        <p>
            I'll make whatever catches my fancy at the moment. I try to stick with the bigger projects, but sometimes I <a target="_blank" href="https://eliterate.blog/toys/blackjack">accidentally make a playable blackjack game</a> because I get distracted by poker card unicode characters.
        </p>
        <p>
            I do not use AI generated code in my projects. I believe it makes code sloppy and unmaintainable over time. I'm not a luddite, I sometimes use it to google when google doesn't deliver, but I don't trust AI enough to let it code for me.
        </p>
        <p>
            Since I can't afford an artist and I dislike AI "art" even more than AI code, I drew the logo myself. It's not very good, but at least it was made by a human and that's good enough for me.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
